# Declare files that always have LF line endings on checkout
* text eol=lf
# Denote all files that are truly binary and should not be modified
*.bin binary
*.bmp binary
*.ttf binary
*.gz binary
*.png binary

# 设备树源码按文本 diff 与合并：用户级 attributes 可能按 DTS 音频把 *.dts 标成 binary（-diff -merge -text），这里写回；text 由上面的 * 规则给出
*.dts diff merge
